  ) : (
    <Chat flex-1 />
  )}
</div>
```

Changes to `page.tsx`:
1. Replace the `import { TaskPanel }` with `import { KanbanBoard }`.
2. Remove the task panel drawer `<div>` block (lines 119-144).
